Greetings, Summoners. Join Soulstonia's developer livestream during Steam Next Fest on Saturday, October 23 at 1:00 PM Pacific!Explore the world of Soulstonia through live gameplay featuring idle goals, combat, summoning, skill progression, quests, and more. The stream will also feature behind-the-scenes insights into the game's development and a live Q&A.Soulstonia's free demo is available now, featuring all five regions, 20+ skills to train, and no playti","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T18:10:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114037494","verified_at":"2026-10-23T18:18:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4432150-1846651706688879","game_id":"steam-4432150","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch 3: Corrupted Cores & Idle Farming Goals","summary":"Demo Patch 3: Corrupted Cores & Idle Farming GoalsGreetings, Summoners!The third Soulstonia Demo patch is here! This update focuses on adding idle farming goals and Corrupted Cores to the game. Corrupted Cores are an evil blight on Soulstonia that you can purify by defeating the enemies that spawn from them. After completing three waves, tons of loot drops and the core is restored. Restored Cores breathe magic back into the world.ChangesAdded Corrupted Cores to the worldAdded idle farming goals ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T05:26:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706688879","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:06:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4432150-1846651706682730","game_id":"steam-4432150","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch 2: Easier Questing & Better Idle Goals","summary":"Demo Patch 2: Easier Questing & Better Idle GoalsGreetings, Summoners!The second Soulstonia Demo patch is here! This update focuses on making the idle goals and quests easier to manage and interact with. This includes editing an re-ordering idle goals on the fly, as well as having easier access to starting and continuing quests from the quest panel.ChangesQuests in the quest panel now have arrow buttons like in the HUDGoals now properly queue the next one on completionAdded plus and minus button","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T18:31:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706682730","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:06:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4432150-1846651706675380","game_id":"steam-4432150","kind":"announcement","title":"Soulstonia is Coming to Steam Next Fest October 19","summary":"Soulstonia is heading to Steam Next Fest!Steam Next Fest begins October 19 at 10 AM PT, and Soulstonia will be participating throughout the event.You don't have to wait until Monday to start playing. The Soulstonia Demo is available now on Windows and macOS.Play the Demo:What's in the Demo?This isn't a short, time-limited sample. The Demo has no playtime or progression cap, so you can spend as much time with your save as you want.The Demo lets you:Complete Act I, with more than 15 quests through","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T19:02:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706675380","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:06:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4432150-1846651706672606","game_id":"steam-4432150","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch 1: Smoother Start for New Players","summary":"Demo Patch 1: Smoother Start for New PlayersGreetings, Summoners!The first Soulstonia Demo patch is here! This update focuses on making your first steps easier to follow, with clearer tutorial guidance, better quest feedback, and quality-of-life improvements throughout your adventure.New tutorial bubbles help guide you through quest auto-pathing, learning spells, conjuring your first Soulstone, and lighting a bonfire. You’ll also find a cleaner interface, more reliable spell autocasting, and a f","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T22:38:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706672606","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:06:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4432150-1846018067928241","game_id":"steam-4432150","kind":"announcement","title":"The Soulstonia Demo is Live Now on Steam","summary":"The Soulstonia Demo is live now!The Soulstonia Demo is now available on Steam for Windows and macOS.This isn't a short, time-limited trial. The Demo has no playtime cap and no progression cap, so you can keep exploring, training, crafting, fighting, and building your Summoners for as long as you want.Play the Demo here: What's in the Demo?The Demo includes a large portion of Soulstonia as it exists today:All five regions are open for exploration20+ core and hybrid skills can be trained all the w","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T03:48:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067928241","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:06:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4432150-1845383656383460","game_id":"steam-4432150","kind":"announcement","title":"Soulstonia Demo Launches October 8 on Steam","summary":"The Soulstonia Demo launches October 8The next chance to jump into Soulstonia is almost here.The Soulstonia Demo launches October 8 on Steam for PC and Mac, giving you a chance to start building your party and exploring Soulstonia ahead of Steam Next Fest and the game's December 10 Early Access launch.Your Summoners have a mind of their own.Take direct control of any Summoner, bring up to five together as a party, or give them Goals and let them get to work. Your Summoners can gather resources, ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T18:17:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656383460","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:06:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4432150-1844115010490782","game_id":"steam-4432150","kind":"announcement","title":"Soulstonia's Public Steam Playtest is LIVE!","summary":"Soulstonia's Public Steam Playtest is LIVE! Play Now!Your cozy adventure awaits. The first public Soulstonia Playtest is officially LIVE!Greetings, Summoners!After months of development, I'm excited to finally open Soulstonia to the public. You can now jump into the game, build your party, explore the world, and experience Soulstonia's unique mix of hands-on and idle gameplay for yourself.Whether you want to take direct control of your Summoners or sit back and watch them get to work, the choice","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-17T03:58:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010490782","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:06:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4432150-1842846814456076","game_id":"steam-4432150","kind":"announcement","title":"Soulstonia Playtest Goes Live September 17, Signup Now","summary":"WISHLIST + SIGNUP FOR THE PLAYTEST NOWThe first public Soulstonia Playtest goes live on September 17! If you've been waiting for a chance to jump into Soulstonia yourself, you'll be able to explore the world, build your party, train skills, complete quests, gather resources, craft equipment, fight enemies, summon creatures, and try out the game's mix of hands-on and idle play. You can request access to the Playtest right now from the Soulstonia Steam page. Request Playtest Access + Wishlist Soul","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-08T15:52:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814456076","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:06:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4432150-1842846814445207","game_id":"steam-4432150","kind":"announcement","title":"Soulstonia Enters Early Access December 10: Signup for the Playtest Now","summary":"Early Access begins on December 10!Greetings, Summoners!I'm excited to announce that Soulstonia will launch in Steam Early Access on December 10, 2026!Before then, you'll have a chance to explore Soulstonia for yourself during the game's first public Steam Playtest.Steam Playtest Signups Are Open NowThe Soulstonia Steam Playtest begins September 17, and you can request access starting today.Visit the Soulstonia Steam store page and click Request Access under the Steam Playtest section to sign up","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-04T03:19:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814445207","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:06:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4432150-1842212951310777","game_id":"steam-4432150","kind":"announcement","title":"Soulstonia Announced: Wishlist Now + Gameplay Reveal with Developer Commentary","summary":"Welcome to Soulstonia!The Soulstonia Steam page is now live, and I'm excited to finally show the game in action.Soulstonia is a cozy idle RPG where you recruit Summoners, build a party, and explore a procedurally generated fantasy world at your own pace.Your Summoners have a mind of their own.T